OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation launched after man
OL,4,Adies following assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating the death of a
OL,7,Fman following an assault in Ballymena
OL,8,Fin the early hours of Saturday morning.
OL,10,FChristopher Houston, also known as
OL,11,FCricki, was found unconscious at the
OL,12,Fjunction of Alexander Street and
OL,13,FBroughshane Street just after 05:00 BST
OL,14,Fon 19 September. He died in hospital on
OL,15,FTuesday night.
OL,17,FPolice said the 42-year-old had been
OL,18,Fthe victim of an assault and sustained
OL,19,Fa head injury.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
