OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation launched after man
OL,4,Adies following assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 39-year-old man was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of grievous bodily harm on
OL,8,FSaturday and subsequently released on
OL,9,Fbail to allow for further police
OL,10,Fenquiries.
